<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt;">The University of Texas at Arlington</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">Application for On-Campus Catering Service</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Caterer Information</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Caterer:</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="caterer_name">{{ caterer_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">DBA:</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="dba_name">{{ dba_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Street:</td>
      <td><span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span></td>
      <td>Suite:</td>
      <td><span data-field="suite_number">{{ suite_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>City:</td>
      <td><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span></td>
      <td>State:</td>
      <td><span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span></td>
      <td>Zip:</td>
      <td><span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></td>
      <td>Website:</td>
      <td><span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Owner/Contact Information:</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Owner Name:</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="owner_name">{{ owner_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Owner Phone:</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="owner_phone">{{ owner_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Owner Email:</td>
      <td><span data-field="owner_email">{{ owner_email }}</span></td>
      <td>Alternate Name:</td>
      <td><span data-field="alternate_name">{{ alternate_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Alternate Phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="alternate_phone">{{ alternate_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Alternate Email:</td>
      <td><span data-field="alternate_email">{{ alternate_email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Owner Information</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Insurer Name:</td>
      <td><span data-field="insurer_name">{{ insurer_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Insurer Phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="insurer_phone">{{ insurer_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>Caterer has been provided a copy, read and agrees to comply with the UTA Catering Terms and Conditions.</p>

  <p>Caterer would like to be considered for alcohol service at University events.</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
      <td>Yes</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
      <td>No</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">The following items must be submitted with this application:</div>
  <ul>
    <li><input type="checkbox"> Current Insurance documentation</li>
    <li><input type="checkbox"> Health Inspection Reports</li>
    <li><input type="checkbox"> Certification of criminal background checks</li>
    <li><input type="checkbox"> Menu</li>
    <li><input type="checkbox"> Guidelines for food handling and preparation</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Submission of this application and required documentation does not guarantee acceptance or permission being given to provide Catering Service at The University of Texas at Arlington. After all documentation has been received and verified as accurate and complete, an "Acceptance" letter will be sent providing valid dates of service. Approval, if granted, is good from the date identified through the next twelve (12) complete calendar months and will expire on the last day of the month indicated. If Caterer desires to continue servicing the University, Caterer must submit a new Application form and updated submittal information within thirty (30) days prior to the expiration date identified in the "Acceptance" letter. A reminder email will be sent to the primary email indicated above. Failure to receive this email does not relieve Caterer of form submission or ability to continue service.</p>

  <p>By signature below, Caterer agrees it has been provided a copy, has read and will comply with the UTA Catering Terms and Conditions. Caterer shall submit with this application all documents required in the UTA Catering Terms and Conditions, including food handling permits, insurance certificates, certification of criminal background checks, and applicable Texas Alcohol and Beverage Commission licenses.</p>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Printed Name</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Signature</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Date</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">*Submit application and required documents via email to: <span data-field="submission_email">{{ submission_email }}</span></p>

  <div class="section-title">E.H. Hereford University Center Office Use Only</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Date Received:</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Approved:</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Yes</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Approved by:</td>
      <td><span data-field="approver_name">{{ approver_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="approval_date">{{ approval_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>